## WEEK-BY-WEEK CONTEXT
Current week: 1
Target: 5 traders, 20 orders/week

## CORE CONSTRAINTS
- WhatsApp-first, backend invisible
- M-Pesa Daraja webhooks mandatory
- Chat overload prevention: shared inbox + tags
- Gikomba reality: voice notes, Sheng/Somali, low literacy
- Sheets→Supabase progression only

## TECH STACK (Week 1-4)
Google Sheets + WhatsApp Cloud API + n8n
M-Pesa Daraja (Sandbox)

## TECH STACK (Week 5+)
Supabase + Whalesync + M-Pesa Daraja live

