## NAirobi Edge Cases (Always Handle)
- Spotty 4G: Offline fallback, batch sync
- Voice notes: Sheng/Somali transcription (Google Speech-to-Text)
- Payment mismatch: KSh 500 received but no order found
- Chat overload: 200+ messages/day, missed orders
- Low literacy: Emoji quick-replies, visual buttons

## ERROR HANDLING PATTERNS
- WhatsApp API down: Queue messages, retry 3x, log to DAILY_LOG
- M-Pesa webhook fails: Screenshot fallback, manual matching
- Google Sheets quota: Rate limit handling, exponential backoff
- Voice note unclear: Flag for manual review, notify trader

## TEST SCENARIOS (Always Include)
1. Happy path: Order → Sheet → WhatsApp confirmation
2. Error: Voice note with unclear Sheng/Somali
3. Error: Payment received but order not found
4. Edge: Offline order capture → sync when online
5. Edge: Multiple orders from same customer

## DEPLOYMENT CHECKLIST
- ngrok tunnel if local webhook testing
- n8n workflow exported to apps/n8n/
- Google Sheets permissions configured
- WhatsApp template approval status checked
- M-Pesa Daraja webhook URL verified

